// Visual Guide Tool","newString":"// Visual Guide Tool","originalFile":"/**
 * PC Pal MCP Tool Server
 *
 * Exposes all PC Pal custom tools as an in-process MCP server
 * for use with the Claude Agent SDK. This makes the tools
